{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JJi2tCQyBDfPdFC1dQBtXc","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Mistral API list voices endpoint documentation\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Models Endpoints - Mistral AI Documentation\",\"url\":\"https://docs.mistral.ai/api/endpoint/models\"},{\"title\":\"Audio Voices Endpoints\",\"url\":\"https://docs.mistral.ai/api/endpoint/audio/voices\"},{\"title\":\"Mistral Endpoint Rules - Updated 2026-05-09 · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://gist.github.com/prachwal/9b31780fccc08ca35e56421725398fae\"},{\"title\":\"Mistral | Voice | Mastra Docs\",\"url\":\"https://mastra.ai/reference/voice/mistral\"},{\"title\":\"Beta Conversations - Mistral AI Documentation\",\"url\":\"https://docs.mistral.ai/api/endpoint/beta/conversations\"},{\"title\":\"Mistral AI API | liteLLM\",\"url\":\"https://docs.litellm.ai/docs/providers/mistral\"},{\"title\":\"Chat Endpoints - Mistral AI Documentation\",\"url\":\"https://docs.mistral.ai/api/endpoint/chat\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about the Mistral API list voices endpoint:\n\nThe list voices endpoint is documented in the Audio Voices Endpoints, which supports pagination with maximum number of voices to return and offset parameters.\n\nThe endpoint is accessible via GET /audio/voices to list voices.\n\nThe successful 200 response returns a VoiceResponse array with items containing created_at, id, name, user_id fields, along with pagination information including page, page_size, total, and total_pages.\n\nThe official Mistral AI documentation for the Audio Voices Endpoints can be found at: https://docs.mistral.ai/api/endpoint/audio/voices\n\nThis endpoint allows you to manage custom voice profiles and is part of Mistral's audio API capabilities.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"17381400-9b77-4d31-b2ef-cf9a00df1edc","u