{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HrUko6tZquuAtuSyQTAZcG","type":"tool_result","content":"# GET List Voices Endpoint - Query Parameters\n\nBased on the API documentation, the **GET /v1/audio/voices** endpoint accepts these pagination parameters:\n\n| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |\n|-----------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `limit` | integer | Not specified | \"Maximum number of voices to return\" |\n| `offset` | integer | Not specified | \"Offset for pagination\" |\n| `type` | string enum | Not specified | Filter between \"all\", \"custom\", or \"preset\" voice types |\n\n**Note:** While `limit` and `offset` are documented as query parameters for pagination, the documentation does not explicitly state default values for these parameters."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"17381400-9b77-4d31-b2ef-cf9a00df1edc","uuid":"984ae553-fedb-4c83-bfb4-4dd4b7ad1099","timestamp":"2026-09-09T22:30:31.549Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":1464396,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# GET List Voices Endpoint - Query Parameters\n\nBased on the API documentation, the **GET /v1/audio/voices** endpoint accepts these pagination parameters:\n\n| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |\n|-----------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `limit` | integer | Not specified | \"Maximum number of voices to return\" |\n| `offset` | integer | Not specified | \"Offset for pagination\" |\n| `type` | string enum | Not specified | Filter between \"all\", \"custom\", or \"preset\" voice types |\n\n**Note:** While `limit` and `offset` are documented as query parameters for pagination, the documentation does not explicitly state default values for these parameters.","durationMs":2996,"url":"https://docs.mistral.ai/api/endpoint/audio/voices"}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cetf5Bad3WttQumsonGSx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The `GET /v1/audio/voices` endpoint takes two query parameters for paging:\n\n- **`limit`** (integer) — maximum number of voices to return\n- **`offset`** (integer) — offset into the result set for pagination\n\nThere's also a `type` query parameter (`all` / `custom` / `preset`) for filtering voice type, but it's not a paging parameter.\n\nSources:\n- [Audio Voices Endpoints](https://docs.mistral.ai/api/endpoint/audio/voices)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":402,"cache_read_input_tokens":30088,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":402},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"17381400-9b77-4d31-b2ef-cf9a00df1edc","uuid":"b3ce435c-b716-4ad3-b648-d546948cab39","timestamp":"2026-09-09T22:30:33.424Z","request_id":"req_011Cetf5AwRSNxw1ZB4GtnYp"}
